+@echo *** Build FAILED -- Please check the error messages ***
+@echo *******************************************************
+@goto :END
+:FAIL
+@echo To run this script you must open a "Visual Studio .NET Command Prompt"
+@echo (64 bit host compiler). The PS4 Orbis SDK must be installed, too.
+:END
