+  |  lgr RC, CRET1
+  |  llgc RA, PC_RA
+  |  j ->BC_TSETR_Z
+  |
+  |//-- Comparison metamethods ---------------------------------------------
+  |
+  |->vmeta_comp:
+  |  llgh RD, PC_RD
+  |  sllg RD, RD, 3
+  |  llgc RA, PC_RA
+  |  sllg RA, RA, 3
